    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56939" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερχν-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rough</i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγχρώδης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.6.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγεῖα κ.</span>
			<i>embossed</i> cups, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
