				Gal.
				18(1).574
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>causing hoarseness</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρῶμα</span>”
